          "end": 25.68,
          "en": "outside of the component as you use inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.68,
          "end": 28.71,
          "en": "So inside this component you might say element is exactly",
          "zh": ""
